# ===========================================
# AI Resume Assistant - Personal Files Exclusion
# ===========================================
# This .gitignore excludes personal information while keeping
# the reusable workflow logic shareable.

# ===========================================
# PERSONAL RESUME & COVER LETTER FILES
# ===========================================
# Exclude all actual resumes (keep only examples/)
*Resume*.txt
*Resume*.pdf
*Resume*.docx
*CoverLetter*.txt
*CoverLetter*.pdf
*CoverLetter*.docx

# ===========================================
# SOURCE OF TRUTH DOCUMENTS (Personal Experience)
# ===========================================
*_Truth.md
*_Reference.md
*_Experience*.md
*Complete_Experience*.md
*_Source_of_Truth.md
Source_of_Truth.md
Search_Profile.md
Application_Responses.md
Questionnaire_Answers.md
Unconfirmed_Facts.md
*_Application_Responses.md
*_How_I_Work.md
*Questionnaire_Answers.md

# Personal documents
*LinkedIn*.pdf
*Projects List*.docx

# ===========================================
# JOB APPLICATION HISTORY (Personal)
# ===========================================
Job_Application_Tracker.csv
Job_Search_Queue.csv
Open_Calls.csv

# Personal job board notes (has account status etc)
Job_Boards_Ranked.md

# Portfolio and showpiece tracking (personal)
PORTFOLIO_READINESS.md
Project_Demo_Videos.md
Showpiece_Backlog.md

# ===========================================
# VOICE MATCHING (raw writing + your profile)
# ===========================================
# Only VoiceMatching/README.md and Example_Voice_Profile.md are tracked
VoiceMatching/*
!VoiceMatching/README.md
!VoiceMatching/Example_Voice_Profile.md

# ===========================================
# APPLICATION FOLDERS (Personal History)
# ===========================================
Archive/
JobSearches/

# ===========================================
# MACHINE-LOCAL AGENT FILES
# ===========================================
# CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md and .claude/skills/ are shared and tracked; personal settings
# live in Search_Profile.md instead. Local overrides stay out:
CLAUDE.local.md

# ===========================================
# PERSONAL ANTI-FABRICATION CHECKLIST
# ===========================================
# Contains person-specific skills to verify
ANTI_FABRICATION_CHECKLIST.md

# ===========================================
# SYSTEM FILES
# ===========================================
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
~$*
~WRL*.tmp
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
nul
*.stackdump
.idea/
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
_pdf_previews/

# Claude Code machine-local settings
.claude/settings.local.json
*.txt.bak

# Conversation logs (date-prefixed files)
202[0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-[0-9][0-9]-*.txt

# ===========================================
# WHAT IS TRACKED (for reference)
# ===========================================
# The following ARE included in the repo:
# - create_pdf.py (PDF generation script)
# - create_cover_letter_docx.py (if exists)
# - Job_Boards.csv (public job board list)
# - CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, GEMINI.md, SETUP.md, .claude/skills/setup/ (agent instructions + onboarding)
# - examples/ folder (template files for new users)
# - README.md
# - RESUME_CRAFTING_GUIDELINES.md, RESUME_TXT_FORMAT.md, workflow guides (JOB_*.md, *_WORKFLOW.md)
# - requirements.txt, job_mcp/ (optional job-search MCP server)
# - VoiceMatching/README.md, VoiceMatching/Example_Voice_Profile.md

# Templates in examples/ are always tracked, even when their names match a personal pattern above
!examples/*
